# Comprehensive Audit: Fix All Features to Match Web Frontend

## Audit Summary

| Feature | Web Frontend | Flutter App | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| AI Disease Config | 9 models (4 tabular + 5 image), correct fields | 8 wrong models, incomplete fields, 3 fake models | ❌ Broken |
| Offline Consultation | Camera record/photo, IndexedDB, sync | Not implemented | ❌ Missing |
| Demographics | Health profile form + BMI calc | Not implemented | ❌ Missing |
| Feedback | Doctor star rating + comment | Not implemented | ❌ Missing |
| Services | Browse specializations → doctors → book appointment | Not implemented | ❌ Missing |
| Dashboard | Fetches real appointments via API | Mock data only | ⚠️ Partial |
| Doctor Dashboard | Fetches real appointments + patient demographics | Mock data only | ⚠️ Partial |
| Pharmacy | Cart + checkout + payment | Loads inventory, mock orders/delivery tabs | ⚠️ Partial |
| Records/OCR | Upload prescription + blood report OCR | Upload + OCR implemented | ✅ OK |
| Triage | Client-side (via chatbot) | Already reworked via chatbot | ✅ OK |
| Chatbot | POST `/api/chatbot/chat` | Already wired | ✅ OK |
| Auth | Login/Register | Already fixed (flat JSON + JWT) | ✅ OK |
| Map | Hospital finder | Implemented | ✅ OK |

