## Phase 1: Fix AI Disease Config

#### [MODIFY] [disease_config.dart](file:///d:/StudioProjects/telemed_app/lib/features/ai_diagnosis/data/disease_config.dart)

- **Rewrite** the `diseaseModels` list to match web's [diseaseConfig.ts](file:///d:/Important/Hackathons/PICT%20Tech%20Fiesta/Telemed-Web/frontend/src/data/diseaseConfig.ts) exactly
- Add `type` field (`tabular` / `image`) to [DiseaseConfig](file:///d:/Important/Hackathons/PICT%20Tech%20Fiesta/Telemed-Web/frontend/src/data/diseaseConfig.ts#16-25) class
- **Remove**: Parkinson's, Breast Cancer, Hepatitis (no backend)
- **Add**: TB, Brain Tumor, Retinopathy, Skin Disease (image models)
- **Fix fields**: Heart (6→13), Diabetes (5→8), Liver (3→10), Kidney (4→24)

#### [MODIFY] [ai_diagnosis_detail_screen.dart](file:///d:/StudioProjects/telemed_app/lib/features/ai_diagnosis/presentation/ai_diagnosis_detail_screen.dart)

- For `image` type models: show only image picker, hide form fields
- Upload image as `image` multipart field (matching backend `upload.single("image")`)

