## Phase 2: Add Offline Video Consultation

Backend: POST `/api/offline-consultation/submit` — multipart (`chiefComplaint`, `symptomsDescription`, `video`, `photo`)

#### [NEW] [offline_consultation_screen.dart](file:///d:/StudioProjects/telemed_app/lib/features/offline_consultation/presentation/offline_consultation_screen.dart)

Form (chief complaint + symptoms) + camera record (10s max) or photo capture + preview + submit → SQLite → sync when online

#### [NEW] [offline_consultation_db.dart](file:///d:/StudioProjects/telemed_app/lib/features/offline_consultation/data/offline_consultation_db.dart)

SQLite helper: [save](file:///d:/Important/Hackathons/PICT%20Tech%20Fiesta/Telemed-Web/backend/routes/ocr.js#112-122), [getPending](file:///d:/Important/Hackathons/PICT%20Tech%20Fiesta/Telemed-Web/frontend/src/utils/indexedDB.ts#261-266), `updateStatus`, [delete](file:///d:/StudioProjects/telemed_app/lib/core/network/api_client.dart#80-81)

#### [NEW] [offline_consultation_sync.dart](file:///d:/StudioProjects/telemed_app/lib/features/offline_consultation/data/offline_consultation_sync.dart)

Sync service uploads pending consultations to backend

