## Phase 3: Add Demographics Screen

Backend: GET/POST `/api/demographics`

#### [NEW] [demographics_screen.dart](file:///d:/StudioProjects/telemed_app/lib/features/demographics/presentation/demographics_screen.dart)

Health profile form matching [web page](file:///d:/Important/Hackathons/PICT%20Tech%20Fiesta/Telemed-Web/frontend/src/app/dashboard/demographics/page.tsx):
- Vital stats: age, gender, height, weight, BMI (auto-calculated)
- Medical history: history, medications, allergies, family history
- Lifestyle: smoking, alcohol, sleep, physical activity

