## Phase 5: Add Services / Appointment Booking Screen

Backend: GET `/api/specializations`, GET `/api/specialization/{spec}`, POST `/api/appointments`

#### [NEW] [services_screen.dart](file:///d:/StudioProjects/telemed_app/lib/features/services/presentation/services_screen.dart)

3-step wizard matching [web page](file:///d:/Important/Hackathons/PICT%20Tech%20Fiesta/Telemed-Web/frontend/src/app/dashboard/services/page.tsx):
1. Browse specializations grid
2. View doctors in selected specialization (name, experience, online status, availability)
3. Book appointment form (date, type: Video/Audio/In-Person, symptoms)

