## Verification Plan

### Automated
- `dart analyze lib` — zero issues
- `flutter build apk --debug` — successful build

### Manual
- Test each AI prediction form has correct fields
- Test offline consultation: record → save → sync
- Test demographics: save → reload
- Test feedback: select doctor → rate → submit
- Test services: browse → select doctor → book appointment
